  "docTitle": "Build It Locally - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Run the full ShopStream Kafka pipeline on your laptop with Docker Compose: start a 3-broker KRaft cluster, send an order, follow it through kafka-ui, query Postgres, add load, send poison messages, scale consumers and watch lag.",
  "hero": {
    "tag": "header",
    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">75 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip docker\">Docker Compose</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Build It Locally (Docker Compose)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">One command starts fourteen containers: three Kafka brokers, the one-shot topics-init, Postgres, five services and four tools. You will send an order, follow it hop by hop, look inside every topic, break things a little, and learn to read what the system tells you.</p>\n      "
  },
